markedup_result_text = "The head priest concludes that the monkey is a divine messenger, sent to warn them that the fruit is impure.

The priests carefully dispose of the offering and begin a lengthy purification ritual.

The monkey watches them throw the fruit away, deeply disappointed in human intelligence."

